        "date": "2026-11-17T14:50:12Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): keep the Sinumerik G83 dwell as P in ms in ISO mode\n\nThe maintainer verified on an 840D in ISO dialect mode (G291) that G83\nreads the P dwell word in milliseconds. Remove the G83 dwell refusal of\nthe first version of this branch: G83 writes P<ms> as on main.\n\nSiemens' ISO dialects Function Manual (07/2021), section 6.3, lists no\nP on G73 and G83. G73 is left as on main; #2354 stays open for the\nmaintainer. G84 and the G86 refusal do not change.\n\nPinned by sinumerik_g83_dwell_posts_p_in_ms,\nsinumerik_g83_without_dwell_is_unchanged and\nsinumerik_g82_dwell_still_posts.\n\nFixes #2349\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
